WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.089 --> 00:00:04.799
With the single possible exception of Devil
Fruits, Swords are easily the single most

00:00:04.799 --> 00:00:10.059
awesome and powerful things in all of One
Piece, so we are going to rank the 13 strongest

00:00:10.059 --> 00:00:11.640
swords EVER in the story.

00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:14.639
Starting with Trafalgar Law’s lethal blade,
Kikoku.

00:00:14.639 --> 00:00:18.130
And while you might not expect this sword
to be ranked very high – especially with

00:00:18.130 --> 00:00:22.519
that fluffy cross guard –&nbsp; it is actually
one the swords that has dealt the most damage

00:00:22.519 --> 00:00:23.780
in the entire story.

00:00:23.780 --> 00:00:27.760
And that’s because this extraordinary blade
has served Law in intense battles against

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:30.550
strong fighters Warlords and Emperors of the
Sea.

00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:34.430
Plus, Law uses Kikoku in his strongest attacks,
like the super destructive Puncture Willie,

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:37.219
which even broke through an entire island.

00:00:37.219 --> 00:00:42.090
We also know that this sword is cursed, which
means it was made by incredibly skilled craftsmen

00:00:42.090 --> 00:00:47.590
and that it is nearly impossible for a weak
swordsman to use because they cannot control

00:00:47.590 --> 00:00:49.070
the will of the blade.

00:00:49.070 --> 00:00:54.270
But Law’s surgical blade of death is certainly
not the only cursed blade that we will see

00:00:54.270 --> 00:00:55.270
in this ranking.

00:00:55.270 --> 00:00:58.629
Now moving on from the Surgeon’s blade,
let’s discuss a sword owned by some one

00:00:58.629 --> 00:01:00.290
who literally died.

00:01:00.290 --> 00:01:03.910
At number twelve we have this skeleton’s
cane sword.

00:01:03.910 --> 00:01:09.790
And Brook named this dapper blade Soul Solid,
mostly because he is able to combine his icy

00:01:09.790 --> 00:01:14.110
cold soul powers to make this sword a devastating
weapon in combat.

00:01:14.110 --> 00:01:18.960
And just like the previous sword, Soul Solid
has clashed with emperors like Big Mom and

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:23.950
it has never let Brook down in over 50 years
of graceful swordsmanship.

00:01:23.950 --> 00:01:29.409
One more thing to mention about Soul Solid
is that it actually has a personality of its

00:01:29.409 --> 00:01:30.409
own.

00:01:30.409 --> 00:01:35.899
This is common with many swords, and the author
has even drawn Brook’s sword as a wrinkly

00:01:35.899 --> 00:01:36.899
old woman.

00:01:36.899 --> 00:01:43.040
But this sword is not even close to the insanely
powerful and famous blades later on in the

00:01:43.040 --> 00:01:44.040
video.

00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:48.140
Next in the ranking is one of the largest
swords ever used in the entire story.

00:01:48.140 --> 00:01:53.149
No not this one or even this one – damn
I wish someone actually used this sword&nbsp;

00:01:53.149 --> 00:02:00.350
– but no, now we have this enormous blade
. This is Funkfreed, and it is the only sword

00:02:00.350 --> 00:02:04.229
in the entire story that actually ate a devil
fruit.

00:02:04.229 --> 00:02:09.149
And because of this rare ability, it can actually
transform from its base sword form, a hybrid

00:02:09.149 --> 00:02:15.500
snake-like blade, and a full elephant form
. Which is an absolutely insane power that

00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:21.500
is completely wasted by the most pitiful character
in the entire story . Because all I’m saying

00:02:21.500 --> 00:02:27.340
is that if this sword was used by an actually
strong character, it could be one of the best

00:02:27.340 --> 00:02:30.280
swords because of its sheer versatility.

00:02:30.280 --> 00:02:34.510
You’d basically never have to worry about
losing your sword because it could just transform

00:02:34.510 --> 00:02:41.450
and come to you.

00:02:41.450 --> 00:02:46.130
While the magnificent elephant sword made
a tremendous impression, the next sword has

00:02:46.130 --> 00:02:51.460
been an important part of the story for nearly
1000 chapters.

00:02:51.460 --> 00:02:58.300
Enter the Sandai Kitetsu which of course is
owned by the Roronoa Zoro.

00:02:58.300 --> 00:03:02.920
He discovered this blade in chapter 97 at
a sword shop in Logue Town.

00:03:02.920 --> 00:03:10.030
Initially, the shop owner refused to allow
anyone to take it because its previous owners

00:03:10.030 --> 00:03:11.090
all died.

00:03:11.090 --> 00:03:15.840
However, Zoro was determined to prove himself
and challenged the blade's curse.

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:19.680
And yes, this is yet another cursed blade
in our ranking.

00:03:19.680 --> 00:03:26.170
But even after earning the sword, Zoro initially
struggles to control the Sandai Kitetsu’s

00:03:26.170 --> 00:03:27.170
bloodlust.

00:03:27.170 --> 00:03:32.129
This goes to show us that a swordsman using
a cursed blade must give extra focus to the

00:03:32.129 --> 00:03:36.319
blade to prevent it from cutting things they
don't intend.

00:03:36.319 --> 00:03:41.769
But that’s not all about this impressive
sword because in One Piece many swords are

00:03:41.769 --> 00:03:47.560
actually ranked based on their exceptional
feats, remarkable craftsmanship, and sheer

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:48.560
power.

00:03:48.560 --> 00:03:53.489
The Sandai Kitetsu is a simple graded blade,
which is the lowest of the swords that are

00:03:53.489 --> 00:03:54.489
actually ranked.

00:03:54.489 --> 00:04:00.750
Though I must add it is still way better than
most normal swords.

00:04:00.750 --> 00:04:08.280
Then ranked above graded blades are 50 Skillful
Grade blades, 21 Great Grade blades, and finally

00:04:08.280 --> 00:04:11.470
12 Supreme Grade blades.

00:04:11.470 --> 00:04:16.940
Now, you may already know about the other
two Kitetsu blades.

00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:22.980
Supposedly, the Sandai is the weakest of the
three, but I am going to exclude the Nidai

00:04:22.980 --> 00:04:26.950
Kitetsu from this ranking since we have only
briefly glimpsed it in Wano.

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:32.410
Plus I actually believe that due to Zoro's
countless battles with the Sandai, it may

00:04:32.410 --> 00:04:36.070
have already surpassed the Nidai Kitetsu in
strength.

00:04:36.070 --> 00:04:38.670
Which yes, that is a thing.

00:04:38.670 --> 00:04:43.380
Swords can actually get stronger in One Piece
based on their weilder’s haki, which we’ll

00:04:43.380 --> 00:04:46.930
discuss more with some of the top ranked swords
later in the video.

00:04:46.930 --> 00:04:50.050
While Sandai’s curse makes it a blade to
be feared, no sword on this ranking has more

00:04:50.050 --> 00:04:51.220
personality than Big Mom’s Napoleon.

00:04:51.220 --> 00:04:56.910
This massive hat-sword has been combined with
a piece of Big Mom’s soul to make it a living,

00:04:56.910 --> 00:04:57.910
breathing creature.

00:04:57.910 --> 00:05:03.389
It can grow to massive sizes and has clashed
with countless strong opponents, including

00:05:03.389 --> 00:05:05.700
Kaido, meaning it has to be an incredibly
sturdy sword.

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:08.960
But even Napoleon hasn't achieved something
as impressive as this next blade, which managed

00:05:08.960 --> 00:05:10.220
to leave a scar on Kaido.

00:05:10.220 --> 00:05:13.070
This is Zoro's famous Wado Ichimonji, one
of the three swords he used to leave a bloody

00:05:13.070 --> 00:05:14.610
wound on Kaido during their rooftop battle.

00:05:14.610 --> 00:05:17.030
And this sword is the closest to Zoro’s
heart, since it also represents his promise

00:05:17.030 --> 00:05:19.550
with his childhood friend to become the world’s
strongest swordsman.

00:05:19.550 --> 00:06:14.190
But besides its historical significance, the
Wado Ichimonji is also one of the Twenty One

00:06:14.190 --> 00:07:09.190
Great Grade Swords, making it one of the strongest
blades ever.

00:07:09.190 --> 00:07:14.590
Many believe it to be Zoro's most important
sword since he's had it since he was a child.

00:07:14.590 --> 00:07:21.490
And personally, I think he will make it even
stronger and it will become one of the highest-ranked

00:07:21.490 --> 00:07:23.150
swords in the story.

00:07:23.150 --> 00:07:27.780
All of that still doesn’t make it stronger
than the next blade on in this ranking, because

00:07:27.780 --> 00:07:34.310
it has been around for hundreds of years and
was used by the literal sword god himself.

00:07:34.310 --> 00:07:40.480
This is none other than Shusui, which belonged
to the legendary samurai Ryuma.

00:07:40.480 --> 00:07:45.639
Zoro earned this blade after defeating the
zombie version of Ryuma, and even Zoro immediately

00:07:45.639 --> 00:07:51.040
noticed that this blade was heavy and incredibly
powerful.

00:07:51.040 --> 00:07:57.360
This sword is another of the 21 Great Grade
swords, but on top of that it is a legendary

00:07:57.360 --> 00:07:58.360
Black Blade.

00:07:58.360 --> 00:08:00.050
What is a Black Blade?

00:08:00.050 --> 00:08:02.310
Well, that’s an excellent question.

00:08:02.310 --> 00:08:08.560
There are only two of these Black Blades in
the entire story, and while we don’t know

00:08:08.560 --> 00:08:15.060
exactly how this process works, we were told
that swords can become black blades after

00:08:15.060 --> 00:08:22.639
countless battles alongside its master . Undoubtedly,
this involves ridiculously high levels of

00:08:22.639 --> 00:08:24.280
haki.

00:08:24.280 --> 00:08:31.630
Sadly, Zoro couldn’t keep Shusui forever
because in chapter 954 he was begged to return

00:08:31.630 --> 00:08:35.050
it to Wano country because it is considered
a national treasure.

00:08:35.050 --> 00:08:38.950
But Zoro wouldn’t give it up for free, and
he only agreed to do this in exchange for

00:08:38.950 --> 00:08:44.990
another blade that we’ll discuss higher
in the rankings.

00:08:44.990 --> 00:08:52.130
Then just outside of the top 5, we have the
infamous cursed sword, the Shodai Kitetsu.

00:08:52.130 --> 00:08:57.200
This sword is the strongest of the Kitetsu
line and is the very first blade in this video

00:08:57.200 --> 00:09:00.350
which owns the Supreme Grade Sword rank.

00:09:00.350 --> 00:09:06.350
And while we have never officially seen this
blade in the story, a common theory is that

00:09:06.350 --> 00:09:15.279
it is owned by this guy because it has an
extremely similar hilt, wrapping, and crossguard

00:09:15.279 --> 00:09:17.450
to the other Kitetsu blades.

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:23.180
So clearly, just based on reputation, its
ranking, and its likely owner, this is going

00:09:23.180 --> 00:09:28.399
to be an extremely powerful sword that I cannot
wait to actually see in action.

00:09:28.399 --> 00:09:33.360
Which means that you should definitely, absolutely,
undoubtedly subscribe to the channel so you

00:09:33.360 --> 00:09:37.810
don’t miss future videos discussing the
secrets of the One Piece world.

00:09:37.810 --> 00:09:48.670
Then launching into the Top 5, we have a blade
that you may confuse for another famous character.

00:09:48.670 --> 00:09:54.910
This is Ace , and this is also Ace . Which
would honestly get a bit confusing around

00:09:54.910 --> 00:10:02.990
the house if they were alive, so parenting
tip #1, probably don’t name your child after

00:10:02.990 --> 00:10:03.990
your favorite sword.

00:10:03.990 --> 00:10:04.990
And if you want more one piece parenting tips,
make sure to subscribe to the channel.

00:10:04.990 --> 00:10:08.550
But for a long time we wondered about the
famous sword of the former pirate king Gol

00:10:08.550 --> 00:10:09.550
D. Roger.

00:10:09.550 --> 00:10:14.240
Many fans believed that Roger gave his sword
to Shanks, but it turns out that this is a

00:10:14.240 --> 00:10:17.220
completely different sword.

00:10:17.220 --> 00:10:22.320
We also recently learned that it is one of
the 12 Supreme Grade blades in a visual book

00:10:22.320 --> 00:10:23.750
written by the author.

00:10:23.750 --> 00:10:29.940
And that makes a lot of sense because this
badass cutlass is Roger’s primary weapon

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:34.670
and he used it to fight the strongest characters
in the entire story.

00:10:34.670 --> 00:10:40.230
However, it is a bit unclear if this sword
is a black blade, since it is never mentioned

00:10:40.230 --> 00:10:44.230
and it is hard to tell from the manga or anime.

00:10:44.230 --> 00:10:50.690
But I wouldn’t be surprised if it was, because
of the many titanic battles Roger fought during

00:10:50.690 --> 00:10:52.040
his life.

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:55.430
And who did Roger fight in many of those epic
clashes?

00:10:55.430 --> 00:11:01.730
That would be the former world’s strongest
man, Whitebeard, with his world famous naginata,

00:11:01.730 --> 00:11:02.730
Murakumogiri.

00:11:02.730 --> 00:11:09.480
While this is the only non-sword in this ranking,
it is undeniably one of the strongest blades

00:11:09.480 --> 00:11:10.670
ever forged.

00:11:10.670 --> 00:11:16.230
Of course it is a Supreme grade blade, just
like his rival’s sword, and Whitebeard masterfully

00:11:16.230 --> 00:11:21.360
used Murakumogiri in combination with his
tremor devil fruit to produce attacks capable

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:22.660
of shattering islands.

00:11:22.660 --> 00:11:28.910
Now let’s move from the strongest blades
of the previous generation into the top 3

00:11:28.910 --> 00:11:32.260
which are all still being used in the story
today.

00:11:32.260 --> 00:11:35.250
And how do you think the top three will turn
out?

00:11:35.250 --> 00:11:41.480
Let’s kick it off with Gryphon, the faithful
blade of the one armed swordsman, Shanks.

00:11:41.480 --> 00:11:46.860
And even today there’s a lot of mystery
surrounding this sword, but there’s also

00:11:46.860 --> 00:11:50.070
some surprising information that was recently
revealed.

00:11:50.070 --> 00:11:54.910
Like, did you know that Shanks can coat this
sword in a fiery aura?

00:11:54.910 --> 00:12:00.800
I’m not sure if that means haki or some
other elemental powers, but damn I can’t

00:12:00.800 --> 00:12:02.630
wait to see it.

00:12:02.630 --> 00:12:07.910
And you also may not have realized that Shanks
did not actually start the story with this

00:12:07.910 --> 00:12:08.910
sword.

00:12:08.910 --> 00:12:14.570
In chapter 1 Shanks uses a sword with this
handguard which is distinctly different from

00:12:14.570 --> 00:12:15.660
Gryphon.

00:12:15.660 --> 00:12:20.180
This could mean that Oda just didn’t have
the final design in mind during chapter 1

00:12:20.180 --> 00:12:27.329
or maybe Shanks obtained Gryphon sometime
in the years between chapter 1 and when we

00:12:27.329 --> 00:12:30.000
first see him with Gryphon in chapter 234.

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:35.500
We also don’t know the official in-world
ranking for Gryphon, but it would not surprise

00:12:35.500 --> 00:12:41.660
me at all to learn that it is a Supreme Grade
sword considering Shanks uses it basically

00:12:41.660 --> 00:12:44.070
anytime he makes a move in the story .

00:12:44.070 --> 00:12:51.459
Then with Gryphon out of the way, at number
two we have Enma, AND, in a bit of a twist,

00:12:51.459 --> 00:12:54.060
its sibling blade, Ame no Habakiri.

00:12:54.060 --> 00:12:58.769
Now I’m putting these two together because
they should essentially be on the same level

00:12:58.769 --> 00:13:01.870
since they were both used by the former Samurai
Oden.

00:13:01.870 --> 00:13:07.019
But since we have the most experience with
Enma, let’s discuss it in detail.

00:13:07.019 --> 00:13:14.269
And we learn just how monstrous this sword
is right after Zoro traded Shusui for it.

00:13:14.269 --> 00:13:21.320
By just holding the sword, Enma will suck
the life force out of you which can literally

00:13:21.320 --> 00:13:24.290
kill you if you aren’t even strong enough.

00:13:24.290 --> 00:13:31.010
This makes Zoro his haki so that he can fully
control the blade and use it to its full potential.

00:13:31.010 --> 00:13:36.110
Hell, it basically forced Zoro to learn advanced
Conqueror’s haki during his final battle

00:13:36.110 --> 00:13:38.250
against Kaido’s right hand man.

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:43.451
Plus Zoro used Enma, plus his other two swords
to block one of the strongest attacks we have

00:13:43.451 --> 00:13:48.850
seen in the entire series . And while it is
currently ranked as a Great Grade blade, we

00:13:48.850 --> 00:13:53.870
are told that if Zoro is able to turn Enma
into a black blade, then it would probably

00:13:53.870 --> 00:13:57.000
be considered one of the Supreme grade blades.

00:13:57.000 --> 00:14:00.380
Which the same could probably be said of Ame
no Habakiri.

00:14:00.380 --> 00:14:04.560
Unfortunately, that sword is not being used
by someone as strong as Zoro at this time.

00:14:04.560 --> 00:14:13.009
And now let’s reveal the single strongest
blade in the entire story.

00:14:13.009 --> 00:14:14.210
No surprises here.

00:14:14.210 --> 00:14:20.089
It is of course the blade of the strongest
swordsman in the world, Yoru.

00:14:20.089 --> 00:14:24.040
Let’s go through the massive list of feats
this blade has.

00:14:24.040 --> 00:14:30.940
It is the only blade in the series that has
both a Supreme Grade rank and is a Black Blade.

00:14:30.940 --> 00:14:36.899
It is insanely massive and can cut through
giant ice mountains with ease.

00:14:36.899 --> 00:14:42.480
It delivered the first real defeat of a straw
hat in the entire story and showed us just

00:14:42.480 --> 00:14:46.190
how underleveled Luffy and Zoro were at the
time.

00:14:46.190 --> 00:14:51.360
It has been used in many legendary duels with
Shanks throughout the years.

00:14:51.360 --> 00:14:55.190
That is undoubtedly an impressive list of
accomplishments.

00:14:55.190 --> 00:14:56.190
But wait!

00:14:56.190 --> 00:14:59.970
There’s even more mystery surrounding this
sword.

00:14:59.970 --> 00:15:05.160
One thing you may not have ever noticed are
these strange markings on Yoru ? Well, these

00:15:05.160 --> 00:15:09.440
markings are actually shockingly similar to
the markings that are on the Empty Throne

00:15:09.440 --> 00:15:10.440
in Mary Geoise.

00:15:10.440 --> 00:15:11.440
I mean, what???

00:15:11.440 --> 00:15:15.000
When I first saw this, it completely blew
my mind.

00:15:15.000 --> 00:15:20.079
I thought he might have worked for the Celestial
dragons or maybe he took Yoru from someone

00:15:20.079 --> 00:15:21.079
who did.

00:15:21.079 --> 00:15:25.839
But whatever the answer is, there’s obviously
many more secrets this legendary sword might

00:15:25.839 --> 00:15:27.399
hold about the One Piece World.

00:15:27.399 --> 00:15:32.120
But as we get closer to the end of the story,
more of these secrets are being revealed,

00:15:32.120 --> 00:15:36.010
and one of the most important secrets is the
truth about devil fruits.

00:15:36.010 --> 00:15:40.959
So if you want to find out which of the MOST
INCREDIBLE devil fruits almost broke One Piece,

00:15:40.959 --> 00:15:43.410
you can watch this video right here.

00:15:43.410 --> 00:15:44.700
Shanks for Watching

